    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### The fallback branch is the point\n\nThe model will occasionally return something outside your list. Without a fallback those items vanish, and you find out weeks later that you lost sales leads.\n\nRouting them to a review queue instead means an off-list answer costs you one glance, not a customer. Watch the rate — if it climbs above a percent or two, the categories are ambiguous rather than the model being wrong.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 3
      },
